<title>USA: Physician Reliance CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Physician Reliance CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Reliance Network Inc said Thursday that it accepted the resignation of Randall Kurtz, executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kurtz resigned to start a physician management consulting firm.  The board appointed a committee which will oversee the recruitment of a successor.  The Company expects to begin reviewing candidates shortly and appoint a successor at least by March 15, 1997.</p>
